  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "MediaInfo.Analysis.Rtsp 26.10.0 - first release\n\nAnalysis of rtsp:// sources for MediaInfo.Wrapper.Core 26.10.0. Targets netstandard2.1, net8.0, net10.0.\n\n- MediaInfoAnalyzerBuilder.WithRtsp(...) enables rtsp:// sources.\n- Video: H.264 and H.265. Audio: described from the session description, not played.\n- Basic and Digest authentication; RTP over the RTSP connection.\n- Capture limited by CaptureDuration, MaximumCaptureBytes and SufficientFrameCount.\n\nLIMITATIONS\n\n- Other video codecs are declined with a message.\n- Duration and Size are 0.\n\nGuide: https://github.com/yartat/MP-MediaInfo/blob/master/docs/async-api.md#rtsp\nRelease notes: https://github.com/yartat/MP-MediaInfo/blob/master/docs/release-notes/26.10.0.md",
